```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Trigger as Trigger Source
    participant Agent as AI Agent / Automation
    participant Config as wow/config.yaml
    participant Files as WoW Files
    participant Parent as Parent Level
    participant Output as Enforcement Surface

    Note over Trigger: pr | commit | code-generation | onboarding | planning

    Trigger->>Agent: Event fires (e.g., PR opened, member added, issue refined)
    Agent->>Config: Read config.yaml
    Config-->>Agent: File manifest + inherits_from

    Agent->>Agent: Filter files by applies_to matching current trigger
    Agent->>Files: Load matching files
    Files-->>Agent: Frontmatter + rule content

    alt Has inherits_from
        Agent->>Parent: Resolve parent config.yaml
        Parent-->>Agent: Parent manifest + files
        Agent->>Agent: Merge (field-level, hard rules locked)
    end

    Agent->>Agent: Evaluate context against resolved rules

    alt Trigger = pr | commit
        alt Hard rule violated
            Agent->>Output: ❌ Blocking comment / CI failure
        else Soft rule not met
            Agent->>Output: 💡 Suggestion comment
        else All rules pass
            Agent->>Output: ✅ Compliance check passed
        end
    else Trigger = planning
        Agent->>Output: 📋 Surface checklist on work item
        Note over Output: Jira comment, workflow gate, or issue panel
    else Trigger = onboarding
        Agent->>Output: 👋 Welcome digest (issue / Slack / email)
        Note over Output: Assigned to new member, closeable
    else Trigger = code-generation
        Agent->>Output: 🤖 Apply as generation constraints
    end
```
